			x: 35.0d
			y: 16.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["78B28FCF40BA6381"]
			description: ["Power, networks and processes that tie this era to the lines you already run."]
			icon: "minecraft:writable_book"
			id: "14B0B5EA38F22432"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "16CDBBB8397BFFB8", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Integration"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14DD94C79F301330"]
			description: ["The first burn of the &6Mk6 Fusion Ring&r runs on the stellar hydrogen and CNO cuts and gives CNO ash plasma, which the converter takes as current. A formed Mk6 ring on UXV hatches and both cuts from Cygnus X-1. The ring refuses a run when its start energy is above what it stores. Power for the gate and the fuel of the next burn. Cuts arrive over AE2 from the filter; the ash goes straight to the converter."]
			icon: "gtceu:cno_ash_plasma_bucket"
			id: "7B79626CA22F70D0"
			rewards: [{ id: "7C4F2045F1A34DAA", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "76FCBE2DBD2CF30B", item: "gtceu:cno_ash_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Hot CNO"
			x: 7.5d
			y: -10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B79626CA22F70D0"]
			description: ["Three helium nuclei make carbon, and carbon takes a fourth to make oxygen. The ring burns helium fuel made from the stellar helium cut and the first burn's ash. Helium fuel from the cryogenic plant, and the same ring and converter as before. Carbon-12 and oxygen-16, the fuels of the next two burns. Send the carbon and oxygen to their own lines. Both are fuel, not waste."]
			icon: "gtceu:helium_burning_ash_plasma_bucket"
			id: "7884A0887B1AEAF8"
			rewards: [{ id: "5A063CAF977A16D5", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5DEB7122722E6FF3", item: "gtceu:helium_burning_ash_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Triple Alpha"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7884A0887B1AEAF8"]
			description: ["The third burn lights carbon vapour from the electron beam furnace and leaves neon, sodium and magnesium once the converter is done. Carbon-12 vapour on a bus, and a quench caster to catch the ash. Ordinary neon, sodium and magnesium for stock. Ash goes to storage; nothing in it is dangerous."]
			icon: "gtceu:carbon_burning_ash_plasma_bucket"
			id: "58CBCB43698A8853"
			rewards: [{ id: "15BC98CD6BFF4289", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "527015E16C32AE3C", item: "gtceu:carbon_burning_ash_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Carbon Burning"
			x: 12.5d
			y: -11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58CBCB43698A8853"]
			description: ["The fourth burn is the last stage the ring runs. Its ash leaves silicon, sulfur and phosphorus once the converter and the quench caster are done with it. Liquefied oxygen-16 from the cryogenic plant, and a ring that has survived the stages before. Silicon-28 for the next era and the biggest plasma payout of the ring. Keep oxygen on its own line from the plant, and send the silicon to storage."]
			icon: "gtceu:oxygen_burning_ash_plasma_bucket"
			id: "556B77B76C999DD0"
			rewards: [{ id: "3B9EFB22B1DC4A2D", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "57D0C572D5862A62", item: "gtceu:oxygen_burning_ash_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Oxygen Burning"
			x: 15.0d
			y: -11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["556B77B76C999DD0"]
			description: ["The &6Direct Energy Converter&r takes four Mk6 plasmas and returns current plus ash, and the &6Plasma Quench Caster&r splits that ash into stock. Both are older machines with new rows. The plasma buckets of the four burns. The converter's output is written final, so no generator array doubles it. The Mk6 figures on the Power tab. Plasma by pipe from the ring; leave the converter's hatches free of anything else."]
			icon: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter"
			id: "1CB676F7EAC74DA9"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C6DF5E366D1C4D7", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1301D119C95C248A", item: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5B53E1B7AB1CCC13", item: "gtceu:plasma_quench_caster", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Ash Into Power"
			x: 17.5d
			y: -11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A4C403FED5649E0"]
			description: [
				"A spinning black hole threaded by a magnetic field drives a current, and the hole slows to pay for it. The &6BZ Dynamo&r burns &6Flux-Loaded Plasma&r made from an FRC cartridge, at Cygnus X-1 only. Flux-loaded plasma from the FRC former and a UXV dynamo hatch. It works in orbit at Cygnus X-1 and nowhere else. The largest single source of the era, a good part of the gate's draw. Cartridges and plasma come from the same line at Cygnus; the power rides the wireless network home."
				"The dynamo is fiction: nobody has tapped a black hole's spin. The Blandford-Znajek process it is named for is real."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:bz_dynamo"
			id: "35B76894EE56CE9E"
			rewards: [{ id: "30C86D8351CE8C6B", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "16BC00FB573790F3", item: "gtceu:flux_loaded_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Spin Down a Black Hole"
			x: 15.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["586BAF51DA2477E3"]
			description: ["Above a pulsar's magnetic poles the field tears charges off the surface. The &6Polar Cap Tap&r lowers a &6Lasagna Electrode&r into that current and burns through it, at Vela only. A fresh electrode for each run, and a place on the Vela platform. It has no sunlight to spare and does not need any. The second source of the gate's draw, and one that costs no fuel but the electrode. Electrodes are laminated on the spot; the output rides the wireless network."]
			icon: "gtceu:polar_cap_tap"
			id: "3CB2242D767833B2"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B10434E6FAEC481", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "14B612B31A5BD25A", item: "grindless:lasagna_electrode", type: "item" }]
			title: "Tap the Polar Cap"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14B0B5EA38F22432"]
			description: ["The &6UXV Parallel Hatch&r lets a mega machine run an enormous number of copies of one recipe at once. It is the most expensive hatch of the era. A machine with a parallel slot, and the power for every copy: each pays its own EU/t. The stellar fractionation hall at full width. Give the machine a bus wide enough for the copies it will run."]
			icon: "gtceu:uxv_parallel_hatch"
			id: "5B064A6634A46338"
			rewards: [{ id: "331AA67E06D12EDC", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5E837776ED089223", item: "gtceu:uxv_parallel_hatch", type: "item" }]
			title: "Parallel Control"
			x: 7.5d
			y: -13.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B064A6634A46338"]
			description: ["The &6Stellar Fractionation Hall&r runs distillation tower and distillery recipes, one mode at a time, and is the UXV member of the mega family. A parallel hatch behind it and the power for its width. Pick the mode in the controller. Every distillation line of the pack on a single machine. One input bus per fluid, one output hatch per cut."]
			icon: "gtceu:stellar_fractionation_hall"
			id: "3CDE309DC5358AFF"
			rewards: [{ id: "717A052ED52E0FEC", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5ABF9A5753B9AE7F", item: "gtceu:stellar_fractionation_hall", type: "item" }]
			title: "Stellar Fractionation Hall"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -13.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14B0B5EA38F22432"]
			description: ["The nitride magnet works winds the &6UXV SMES Cell&r with pasta strand. It is the largest store in the pack. Strand tape and lasagna plate from Vela, and the nitride magnet works from UEV. The UXV wireless tier. Nothing to feed. Size the towers for your busiest hour."]
			icon: "grindless:uxv_smes_cell"
			id: "3F5ABDEF2254EC50"
			rewards: [{ id: "1E7EFD50A6261DA8", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3F72A32DFC24D6F2", item: "grindless:uxv_smes_cell", type: "item" }]
			title: "The UXV Cell"
			x: 7.5d
			y: -14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F5ABDEF2254EC50"]
			description: ["Move your towers onto &6UXV SMES Cells&r and the wireless network carries UXV to every platform, Cygnus X-1, Vela and Cassiopeia A included. Every formed tower holding UXV cells. Until then the network stays at UIV. The wireless hatches at UXV, and the gate's load at Cygnus X-1. Add cells when the network dips at your busiest hour."]
			icon: "gtceu:uxv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "13386736693D927A"
			rewards: [{ id: "5CF66D4F358430AC", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "3CC6036C7C92605C", item: "gtceu:uxv_wireless_energy_hatch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "53588EB6E5331C42", item: "gtceu:uxv_wireless_dynamo_hatch", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The Network Goes UXV"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13386736693D927A"]
			description: ["The gate to OpV draws 2,147,483,648 EU/t for sixty seconds. One BZ dynamo and two polar cap taps on the wireless network cover it, or the Mk6 through the converter. The Power tab shows each source."]
			icon: "gtceu:uxv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "151A6D1089A0C953"
			rewards: [{ id: "5CA3FDF5A8919FB8", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "14C4D63011B4FAF9", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Sixteen Amps of UXV"
			x: 12.5d
			y: -14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14B0B5EA38F22432"]
			description: ["The &6Cryogenic Plant&r, &6Extraction Cascade&r, &6Platinum Plant&r, &6Hot Strip Mill&r, &6Syngas Plant&r and &6Fluorspar Kiln&r each take a new mode: stellar helium and oxygen fuels, knot dust and flux dross, sputter-grade platinum, foils and laminations, platform syngas and fluorine. The controllers you already own, and cuts and dust from the stars. The Mk6 fuels, the titanium-44 line and the targets of the spintronic lane. Each plant hands its product on by pipe. Return the nitrogen and the water."]
			icon: "gtceu:cryogenic_plant"
			id: "175BA546E30279E1"
			rewards: [{ id: "597AE1215C20F5B2", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
