		{
			dependencies: ["7A933F3FF611A461"]
			description: ["Above a pulsar's magnetic poles the field tears charges off the surface. The &6Polar Cap Tap&r lowers an electrode into that current and burns through it, at Vela only. A UIV hull, the neutron star site casing and a mast of insulator rings. Power at Vela, for the gate hold and the machines out there. Electrodes by ME; the voltage is real, a way to collect it is not."]
			icon: "gtceu:polar_cap_tap"
