		{
			dependencies: ["12376A5961A338E7"]
			description: ["Slow a core's positrons into positronium, cool it, then let it annihilate all at once into a beam. The &6Annihilation Laser Works&r makes the gamma laser module. A UIV hull, the robust casing as a gamma shield and a Penning trap. The gamma laser module, and the UXV emitter built round it. Titanium-44 cores by ME; the modules are few, so keep them in a chest."]
